      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu achiamba, “Dambi ya atu a Juda yaandikpwa na kalamu ya chuma yenye lutsa ra alimasi, ichichorwa kpwenye mioyo yao na phenye pembe za phatu pha kulavira sadaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata ana aho atambukira phatu pha kulavira sadaka vizuka vyao viihwavyo Ashera, kanda-kanda ya chila muhi muitsi na dzulu ya vidzango vire, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na dzulu ya myango kpwenye tsi yogbwa. Utajiri wenu na akiba zenu ndazilavya zewe kama garama ya dambi zenu chila phatu kpwenye tsi yenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Indabidi muiangamize yo tsi niriyokuphani dza urisi wenu. Nami ndakuhendani muahumikire maadui genu kpwenye tsi msiyoimanya, mana mkalamusa tsukizi zangu ambazo zindaaka dza moho hata kare na kare.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu achiniambira hivi, “Phiya ukaime ryango ra Benjamini, ryango ambaro rinahumirwa ni afalume a Juda kuinjirira na kutuluka, na maryango gosi ga Jerusalemu ambago atu osi nkugahumira kpwa kutsupira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukaambire, ‘Phundzani neno ra Mwenyezi Mlungu aambavyo mwi afalume na atu a Juda na chila mutu asagalaye Jerusalemu atsupiraye na maryango gaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NEH.13.15+NEH.13.16+NEH.13.17+NEH.13.18+NEH.13.19+NEH.13.20+NEH.13.21+NEH.13.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nehemia 13:15–22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba, “Dzimanyirireni msitsukule mzigo Siku ya Kuoya au kuureha Jerusalemu kutsupira maryango gaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.20.8+EXO.20.9+EXO.20.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kutsama 20:8–10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.5.12+DEU.5.13+DEU.5.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kumbukumbu 5:12–14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha msituluke na mzigo kula mwenu nyumbani au kuhenda kazi Siku ya Kuoya, ela yiikeni takatifu dza nrivyoalagiza akare enu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela phahi, taayaniphundza wala kuhega masikiro gao. Badalaye akala na likakado, taayalonda kuniogopha wala kudzifundza kula kpwangu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba, “Mchiniphundza na kusareha mizigo kutsupira maryango ga mudzi Siku ya Kuoya, ela kuihenda Siku ya Kuoya ikale takatifu na msihende kazi siku hiyo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "phahi afalume na ana a afalume anaomlunga mfalume Daudi katika utawala, phamwenga na atu a Juda na asagalao Jerusalemu, andainjira kutsupira maryango ga mudzi hinyu kuno akapanda farasi na magari ga kuvwehwa ni farasi. Nao mudzi uhu undasagala atu siku zosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atu andakpwedza kula midzi ya Juda, malalo ga phephi na Jerusalemu, kula tsi ya Benjamini, kula Shefela, kula tsi za myango na kula Negebu, edze arehe sadaka za kuochwa, sadaka za kawaida, sadaka za unga, uvumba na sadaka za shukurani kpwenye nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela ichikala tamundaniphundza na kuihenda Siku ya Kuoya kukala takatifu kpwa kusatsukula mizigo muinjirapho maryango ga Jerusalemu, phahi ndaasa moho usiozimika ndioocha maryango ga Jerusalemu na madzumba ga mudzi wa chifalume.” ’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
